    "summary": "Get All Brands",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "Read operation. Retrieve all required pages before reporting complete totals. Returns a **paginated** list of brands.\n\nThe response is a standard paginated envelope: the brands are in `data[]` (each item is `id`, `name`, `created`, `modified`), alongside pagination metadata (`current_page`, `per_page`, `total`, `last_page`, `from`, `to`, `links`, and the `*_page_url` fields). The default page size is 20; use `?page=N` to move between pages.\n\nAn optional trailing path segment sets the data-detail level (e.g. `/brand/list/1`); it can be omitted for the default detail level.",
